\ A `once` cycle still names the words it runs through inside an AOT binary.
\
\ This is the guarantee the slot table exists to preserve. A lowering that gave each word a bare
\ value-and-flag pair would have no `forcing` state to detect re-entry with, so a cycle would run
\ until the stack guard fired and would name neither word. One live cell per slot is what keeps
\ the diagnostic.

flag-sound: ( -- fixnum ) once [ boom-sound ] ;
boom-sound: ( -- fixnum ) once [ flag-sound ] ;

[ flag-sound ] [ message: @get print-line ] recover

\ The unwind left both cells cold, so entering from the other end names the chain from there
\ rather than reporting a word still marked as forcing.
[ boom-sound ] [ message: @get print-line ] recover
